    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just tell you you're not a monster. but i feel like i am. it's like i've poisoned myself from the inside out. i look in the mirror and i don't even see someone worth saving anymore. i just see this... empty, selfish thing that shouldn't even be taking up space.",
